# The fixture binaries are byte-compared against a fresh generation by
# tests/unit/test_benchmark_fixture.py. Any end-of-line or encoding conversion
# on the way into or out of the index would break that comparison on one
# platform and not the other, which is the hardest kind of CI failure to read.
# Marked explicitly rather than relying on git's content heuristic.
*.dll binary
*.exe binary

# The manifest is compared as an exact string too.
build_manifest.json text eol=lf
